Eyekeapop is a Chrome extension that finds deals on IKEA products across second-hand marketplaces — Wallapop, Vinted, Milanuncios. It detects the product name and category directly from the IKEA page's DOM and runs a smart search across those marketplaces, so you can check the resale price before buying new.

Manifest V3 extension with [Gumroad](https://indiantinker.gumroad.com/l/klmrhv) licensing for a shipped Pro mode, and Umami analytics.

You can check the extension [here](https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/eyekeapop-%E2%80%93-segundamano-a/fgaidhjafaojheifceghgcgoehchodmb).
